# GioAviation.aero — files excluded from the static-assets upload.
# The Worker's `assets.directory` is the repo root ("./"), so without this
# file everything here (including .git internals and the Worker source
# itself) gets read as a candidate static asset. None of this is meant to
# be served as a file.

.git/
src/
wrangler.jsonc
schema.sql
migration-002-backend.sql
README.md
README-DEPLOY.md
